# Copy this file to ".env" (same folder) and paste your Google Maps key. Restart "npm run dev" after saving.
# In Google Cloud Console enable: "Maps JavaScript API" and "Directions API" (billing must be on; Google gives a free monthly credit).
# Restrict the key to your website address (HTTP referrers).
# Leave it empty and the app keeps working with the free OpenStreetMap map.
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_KEY=
